LEGAL NOTICE
============

rar-rs is an independent Rust implementation of the RAR archive format, built
for software conservancy, interoperability and education. It is not affiliated
with, endorsed by, or connected to RARLAB, and it contains no code from
RARLAB's proprietary `unrar`. Archive structures are implemented from public
format descriptions and the independent open-source references credited below.

